# Frontend environment variables (Vite).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in values as needed.
# Only variables prefixed with `VITE_` are exposed to the browser bundle.
# Never commit real secrets here — use placeholders only.
#
# The frontend currently reads NO VITE_ vars from source: the API base URL is
# hardcoded to "/api" in src/api.ts. Add any future VITE_ vars below, e.g.:
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="/api"
